<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD POLAND 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD POLAND 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia took an unbeatable</p>
<p>3-0 lead over Poland in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group</p>
<p>two, third round tie after winning the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Jan Kroslak/Karol Kucera beat Michal Gawlowski/Michal Chmela</p>
<p>6-1 6-4 6-7 (5-7) 6-0</p>
</text>
